      "content": {
        "title": "Prepare with free courses and practice projects",
        "paragraphs": [
          "Start with the [free Lattice courses](/learn), which cover every topic on the exam with short videos, quizzes and hands-on projects you can run in a free sandbox account. Most learners spend four to six weeks preparing.",
          "Candidates who pass usually have:"
        ],
        "bullets": [
          {
            "lead": "Six months of practice",
            "text": "building, testing and documenting models in a real project, ideally one that runs on a schedule in production."
          },
          {
            "lead": "Hands-on experience",
            "text": "with sources, snapshots and incremental models."
          },
          {
            "lead": "Comfort with version control",
            "text": "including branches, pull request reviews, merges and resolving the occasional conflict."
          }
        ],
        "primary": {
          "label": "Register now",
          "href": "/signup"
        },
        "media": {
          "assetRole": "photo.composite-scene",
