    {
      "section": "interactive.faq-accordion",
      "variant": "default",
      "content": {
        "title": "Frequently asked questions",
        "items": [
          {
            "q": "How long is each exam?",
            "a": "Each exam lasts two hours and contains a mix of multiple-choice, multi-select and short scenario questions."
          },
          {
            "q": "How much does an exam cost?",
            "a": "Pricing depends on your region. You will see the final price, including any taxes, before you confirm a booking."
          },
          {
            "q": "Are there discounts for teams?",
            "a": "Yes. Teams that book five or more exams receive a discount. [Contact us](/contact) for a quote."
          },
          {
            "q": "Can I retake an exam if I do not pass?",
            "a": "You can retake an exam after a waiting period of fourteen days. A retake is booked and paid for like a new attempt."
          },
          {
            "q": "How long is a certification valid?",
            "a": "Certifications are valid for two years. You can renew by passing the current version of the exam."
          },
          {
            "q": "What languages are available?",
            "a": "Exams are offered in English, Spanish, Portuguese, French, German and Japanese."
          },
          {
            "q": "Do I need a paid Lattice account?",
            "a": "No. The free developer account is enough to complete every practice project in the preparation courses."
          },
          {
            "q": "How is the exam proctored?",
            "a": "Exams are proctored remotely. You will need a webcam, a microphone and a quiet room for the full session."
          },
          {
            "q": "What happens if my connection drops?",
            "a": "Your progress is saved. Reconnect within ten minutes and the proctor will let you resume where you left off."
          },
          {
            "q": "Can I reschedule my exam?",
            "a": "You can reschedule at no cost up to forty-eight hours before your appointment."
          },
          {
            "q": "Will I receive a digital badge?",
            "a": "Yes. Everyone who passes receives a shareable digital badge and a certificate with a verification link."
          },
          {
            "q": "Are accommodations available?",
            "a": "Yes. Request accommodations when you register and our team will follow up. [Reach out](/contact) with any questions."
          },
          {
            "q": "Is there a scholarship program?",
            "a": "We fund a number of exam scholarships each year. [Read about belonging at Lattice](/about-us/belonging) to learn more."
          },
          {
            "q": "Do questions change between versions?",
            "a": "Exams are refreshed when the product changes significantly, and every version is announced at least a month ahead."
          },
          {
            "q": "Can my employer pay for the exam?",
